    "140697083622793": "Descriptor[0] is callback context: wrapper ABF292/ABF2D1 (or ABF314/ABF31E) stores its original RDX at descriptor[0]. Body saves descriptor at B08092 and loads RSI here.",
    "140697083620438": "Context+40h slot pointer; caller B6F8FE stores RSI, the SfcIsFileProtected name-lookup result from B6F6F9/B6F781. Native B0BF0B calls through this slot with RCX=0,RDX=UTF-16 buffer.",
    "140697083625227": "Calls the context+40h function from SfcIsFileProtected name lookup (selector22 B6F6F9). RCX=0; RDX=R14 UTF-16 buffer. Return nonzero saved as byte at B0BF0F. Actual resolved address not captured; full report semantics unfinished.",
    "140697083611026": "DWORD returned through B0877D output pointer is compared with GS:30 pointer+40h (TEB ClientId.UniqueProcess layout). Mismatch branches B0D9C8. Actual requested API identity not captured.",
    "140697083611873": "Captured native modulo32 arithmetic decodes EDX=FFFFFFFC (-4). GetWindowLongPtr WNDPROC-index hypothesis; request-resolved API identity not proved. Returned pointer/value feeds unary context+38h call B08B69.",
    "140697083611630": "Captured native modulo32 arithmetic decodes R8D=100. Call receives original callback input and second stack buffer. Identity not yet proved.",
    "140697084033278": "Callback context+40h = RSI from SfcIsFileProtected name lookup; native callback B0AC56/B0BF0B follows this exact slot.",
    "140697084033294": "Callback context+48h = pointer to prefix helper output+8; verify helper counter/output offset interpretation before naming whole layout."
  },
